# Candidate delta for /etc/enclave-lease-relay/relay.env on eu-central (observed: provider quorum, release 94f4ebdf..).
# Field names from lease-relay-source 433f04fa1 relay/lease-relay.env.example. NOT applicable as-is: see blockers.
# KEEP (local merge, values never copied here): LEASE_RELAY_RECORD, LEASE_RELAY_DIGEST, LEASE_RELAY_MAX_FLOAT_ETH,
#   LEASE_RELAY_MIN_FLOAT_ETH, LEASE_RELAY_LISTEN, LEASE_RELAY_ARTIFACT_SHA256 (artifact sha must match the NEW release)
# REMOVE (mixed provider+verifier selections are refused by 433f04fa1):
-LEASE_RELAY_RPCS=base-rpc.publicnode.com,mainnet.base.org,base-mainnet.public.blastapi.io
-LEASE_RELAY_QUORUM=2
# ADD:
+ENCLAVE_CHAIN_AUTHORITY=verifier
+ENCLAVE_CHAIN_VERIFIER=http://127.0.0.1:<MERGE: local verifier port>/
+ENCLAVE_CHAIN_TX_BACKEND=http://<MERGE: 127.0.0.1 or private IPv4 of the OWN Base node>:<port>/
# BLOCKERS:
# 1. Placement: eu-central has no local verifier and no private-IPv4 path to the own Base node (loopback-only on the RPC host).
#    Either relocate the relay next to the RPC host (then Metal0 leaseGas.relays changes: separate reviewed control-config
#    change) or add a reviewed private transport; never point TX_BACKEND at a public provider.
# 2. Release: deployed 94f4ebdf.. is not identified with lease-relay-source 433f04fa1; install the reviewed artifact first.
# 3. Root review finding (lease-relay-root-review.md): 10 s socket idle timeout during relay execution vs requestTimeoutMs
#    60 s; confirm it is fixed and regression-tested in 433f04fa1 before production.
